<p class="kicker">National Trading Card Association</p>
<h1>About NTCA</h1>
<p class="lede">The National Trading Card Association is a community of collectors, shops and events uniting the trading card hobby. Our public directory and calendar are built from the live NTCA database — not a static snapshot.</p>
<p>We exist for a practical purpose: helping people find shops, shows, and the history of the hobby. Membership and listing tools are rolling out through Preview.</p>
<p><a class="btn" href="/signup">Join the association</a> <a class="btn ghost" href="/shops">Find shops</a></p>
<p class="meta">Navigation labels on this Preview site are provisional while the public menu is confirmed.</p>
